{
  "_comment": "Per-layer configuration for pregen_dup_gate.py. entity_fields/operation_fields/mode_fields define the 3-axis scenario grid that must be unique per sample. label_fields are the technology/runtime labels that must NEVER be the only thing that varies. min_entity_pool is the fresh-pool size required to reach the layer target without reusing a (entity, operation, mode) cell more than max_combo_reuse times.",
